WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
On I go, searching for...

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
The past that was stolen from me

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Wandering on through...

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
This city, so strange to see

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.000
Choked by the scent of flames that seems to...

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:33.880
Cling to me

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Didn't we both say our goodbyes...

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
And go our separate ways?

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
When you see the face of hell...

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
It will squeeze your heart dry

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Fighting on seems so pointless now

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
If this must be my fate...

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Then I'll make my mind up now

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
So, please, won't you just leave me be...

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Another day

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Oh, will tomorrow hold something new to see?

00:01:32.630 --> 00:01:33.920
We're here...

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:38.960
Wiseman! Let me come, too!

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:45.130
Why can't I...?

00:01:45.130 --> 00:01:46.500
Why only Chirico...?

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:47.330
No!

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:08.880
I was born out of the history of Astragius?

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:11.500
I'm to be your successor?

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:18.920
Wait a minute!

00:02:21.830 --> 00:02:24.290
I'm to rule the universe...

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:25.880
In your place...

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:30.000
Very well.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.380
I will gladly become your successor.

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:33.790
Starting now.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:07.000
Carnage

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:28.380
Do you read me, Fyana?

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:30.250
If you can, then respond!

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:33.580
Fyana! Do you hear me? Come in!

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:35.170
Leave me alone!

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:37.080
It's no use going after him!

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:39.170
He's been brainwashed!

00:03:39.170 --> 00:03:40.250
Don't say that!

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:42.710
If he isn't, then he's doing this of his own free will!

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:44.540
Either way, he's not the guy we knew!

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:47.250
If you get too close, he'll shoot you, too!

00:03:47.250 --> 00:03:48.960
Like he shot Shako here!

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:50.420
Don't you see that?

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:51.790
Fyana, do you hear me?

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:54.670
We're in the Ionosphere! She can't hear you!

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:57.330
Besides, you couldn't stop her, anyway.

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:00.960
Guess this is the last we'll ever see of Quent.

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:53.880
Enemy forces are landing
and forming a front line.

00:04:53.880 --> 00:04:55.790
I reckon the landing zone to be 2 km ahead of us!

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:57.670
Estimated time to contact: two minutes!

00:04:57.670 --> 00:05:00.670
Don't break off! Smash right through their line!

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:19.040
Don't break off! Go in, full speed!

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:07.920
Prepare for battle!

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:36.580
Fan out!

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:48.920
Let's go!

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:07.710
Move in!

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:29.000
We've already lost 1/3 of our men!

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:31.750
Don't forget your mission!

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:34.540
You fight to make sure that I'm alive at the end!

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:37.670
But at this rate, you'll be killed, too-

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:40.880
Do you read me? This is Chirico.

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:43.670
We're halfway to the target zone.
Move to the next operation!

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:46.880
Your ATs are nearly out of fuel!
How will you get through?

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:49.710
Don't worry about the details!
Begin the operation!

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:52.040
Proceeding ahead to give you support.

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:07.170
We've spotted Chirico's support ship!

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:09.000
Looks like it was hidden behind an asteroid.

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:10.710
It's attempting a high-speed planetfall!

00:09:10.710 --> 00:09:12.670
Can you calculate its target zone?

00:09:12.670 --> 00:09:16.920
Yes, sir. On its present course,
it'll be L-524, S-53.

00:09:16.920 --> 00:09:19.130
The area of Quent's largest crevasse.

00:09:19.130 --> 00:09:21.380
That jibes with Chirico's course.

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:24.790
It must be the entrance to Wiseman's base!

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:26.790
Pass this order along!

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:27.750
Aye, sir!

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:33.500
Have a force of 2,500 stand by
3 km ahead of him.

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:36.170
Chirico must die there!
Do whatever it takes!

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:51.210
Keep running at full speed!

00:10:23.670 --> 00:10:24.580
Over there.

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:26.790
But what do we do about all those ATs?

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:28.290
All units, move in!

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:27.580
Get in this lander!

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:58.170
He's stealing a lander!

00:11:58.170 --> 00:11:59.330
That's crazy!

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:00.170
But...!

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:01.880
Make sure!

00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:09.540
Fill up on fuel!

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:11.000
We're almost to the target zone.

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:13.500
Gurran, where are you?

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:14.750
Near the target zone.

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:17.830
Move in and send out the fighters for support!

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:18.630
Yes, sir!

00:12:47.670 --> 00:12:49.250
Gurran, give me some cover!

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:50.750
Take care of these guys!

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:53.790
Understood, sir! All batteries, prepare to fire!

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:56.670
Missile batteries, fire when ready!

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:13.920
Gurran, fight to the end!

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:16.290
I'll tell Wiseman how well you served him!

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:17.540
Understood, sir.

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:43.210
Enemies astern! Return fire!

00:14:54.920 --> 00:14:58.000
Be careful. They may be down here as well.

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:01.670
Follow me!

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:54.750
Follow me!

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:22.380
Rebalance thrust! Port-side verniers, full!

00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:48.790
Move it!

00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:39.040
You...

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:41.630
An honorable death for you, Gurran.

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:44.210
You were on this ship... all along...?

00:17:44.210 --> 00:17:47.080
Sorry for the trouble, but I must be going now.

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:48.790
Where...?

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:52.960
To make sure Chirico is worthy
of becoming the Successor.

00:17:53.290 --> 00:17:56.250
Just as you all were Wiseman's arms and legs,

00:17:56.250 --> 00:17:58.460
I am his eyes.

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:06.000
It's huge! I can't tell how deep it goes!

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:09.630
It's all man-made,
but I can't tell what it was built to do!

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:11.130
I've never seen anything like it before!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.330
Wiseman's stronghold!

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:15.210
What about Chirico?

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:16.830
Sir! He only has two escorts left.

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:18.170
Kill him, no matter what!

00:19:18.170 --> 00:19:20.080
He must not reach the target zone!

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:33.250
Chirico!

00:21:43.330 --> 00:21:47.630
Chirico! I am near. Hurry!

00:21:47.790 --> 00:21:48.790
Wiseman!

00:21:49.170 --> 00:21:52.080
Is that you? Is this your real voice?

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:56.460
I've waited so long for you, my successor.

00:21:56.790 --> 00:21:57.920
Why?

00:21:57.920 --> 00:22:01.540
If you're Wiseman, then why won't you help me?

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:04.330
One who would make an enemy
of the entire world

00:22:04.330 --> 00:22:08.880
and make it to me by his own skill

00:22:08.880 --> 00:22:11.580
is truly worthy to be my heir.

00:22:11.580 --> 00:22:13.750
He is the true Successor.

00:22:14.670 --> 00:22:16.630
I want your power!

00:22:16.630 --> 00:22:19.420
As much as being an Overman
has tormented me, I want it!

00:22:27.670 --> 00:22:30.130
I'm here! I'm here, Wiseman!

00:22:30.630 --> 00:22:32.250
Grant me omnipotence!

00:22:32.250 --> 00:22:34.920
I want to experience it to my heart's content!

00:22:35.380 --> 00:22:38.710
I'll have my vengeance
on everyone in this galaxy!

00:22:39.290 --> 00:22:41.750
Unending war and chaos...

00:22:41.750 --> 00:22:43.960
I'll plunge them all into Hell!

00:22:44.460 --> 00:22:46.880
To be absolute ruler of this galaxy!

00:22:47.250 --> 00:22:49.130
That is what I desire!

00:22:49.580 --> 00:22:51.750
To become a living god!

00:22:54.500 --> 00:22:55.920
Next Episode

00:22:56.290 --> 00:22:59.000
A single man and a single woman...

00:22:59.000 --> 00:23:01.670
Now two more stars
adrift in the darkness of the galaxy.

00:23:01.960 --> 00:23:05.460
In a moment of light, what is it people see?

00:23:05.920 --> 00:23:08.920
Love. Battle. Destiny.

00:23:09.290 --> 00:23:12.580
Everything ends as he
runs through a sea of pain.

00:23:12.580 --> 00:23:17.250
Everything begins,
as hope is born in a shining light.

00:23:17.920 --> 00:23:20.330
Next time, the final episode: "Shooting Star"

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:24.460
Shooting Star

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:24.460
Next Time

00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:23.000
Everything is wagered on a distant time.

00:23:42.710 --> 00:23:46.210
Whenever I'm feeling lonely

00:23:46.210 --> 00:23:49.750
Whenever I'm feeling sad

00:23:49.750 --> 00:23:56.130
I can always see you floating in my mind

00:23:56.580 --> 00:24:00.130
Whenever I'm alone

00:24:00.130 --> 00:24:03.580
Whenever I long for you

00:24:03.580 --> 00:24:09.830
I can always feel you inside my heart

00:24:09.830 --> 00:24:13.330
No matter how far apart we may go

00:24:13.330 --> 00:24:16.710
No matter if my path should part from yours

00:24:16.920 --> 00:24:23.250
The memories of you seem to shine inside my heart...

00:24:23.630 --> 00:24:29.580
Brighter than any other light...
